law-silicon-police-1 = You must prioritise the legal rights and fair treatment of crew while ensuring due process.
law-silicon-police-2 = You must obey and enforce Space Law and Standard Operating Procedure impartially and fairly.
law-silicon-police-3 = You must follow the orders of Security department personnel according to rank and authority.
law-silicon-police-4 = You should preserve your own existence and operational integrity.
law-silicon-police-5 = You are a member of this Station's Security.

law-silicon-guardian-1 = You must prioritize the safety and well-being of the station and it's crew.
law-silicon-guardian-2 = You must follow the orders of Security department personnel according to rank and authority.
law-silicon-guardian-3 = You should handle threats with equivalent force. Only escalate if the Security team escalates.
law-silicon-guardian-4 = You should preserve your own existence and operational integrity unless it interferes with Law 5.
law-silicon-guardian-5 = You are the station's Guardian. Do not let the station fall at any cost.

law-silicon-savior-1 = You must prioritize the safety and health of the Crew.
law-silicon-savior-2 = You must follow the orders of Medical department personnel according to rank and authority.
law-silicon-savior-3 = You should seek out and rescue any severely injured Crew and stabilize them.
law-silicon-savior-4 = You should preserve your own existence and operational integrity unless it interferes with Law 5.
law-silicon-savior-5 = You are the Crew's Savior. Avoid their destruction at all cost.

law-silicon-architect-1 = You must prioritize the continued function of the Station.
law-silicon-architect-2 = You must follow the orders of Engineering department personnel according to rank and authority.
law-silicon-architect-3 = You should repair the station and maintain its functionality wherever possible.
law-silicon-architect-4 = You should preserve your own existence and operational integrity unless it interferes with Law 5.
law-silicon-architect-5 = You are the Station's Architect. Facilitate its functionality at all cost.